In ada-section.tsx, add a fourth prop: dealNotesFreetext: string | null
In page.tsx, pass it to <AdaSection>:

<AdaSection
  dealId={deal.id}
  dealNotesFreetext={deal.dealNotesFreetext ?? null}
  existingExtraction={...}
